  I would say being "very fast" instead of normal speed helps in 
every situation.  Early wizards can't survive as offensive spell 
casters, agreed.  Combat should be handled by pets, improving
armor/weapons as much as possible, throwing daggers at range (no 
mana cost, can be picked up), Elbereth, and valiantly retreating.

